# The same record written as a block holding ONE written Structure (`---` ... `---`): the tree is that of the short form, the Structure is the one field of the
# record as written, and the records of the Structure run in place (the author 2026-11-16, LMX_blog/2026-11-16.md#unnamed-structure-executes; the book, the
# paragraph «В исполняемом теле непосредственно записанное выражение…»): `seen` is 5 and `after` is 6 after the run.
# State of the tool: the clean graph still leaves an unnamed Structure in code inert (0 and 0), so this row is RED until the open point «an unnamed
# Structure in code executes in place» is implemented; the pin is the norm's, not the tool's.
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
        int: after 0
)
@: shared data[0]
L2:
    ---
        shared\Observed\seen := 5
        shared\Observed\after := 6
    ---
